sequenceDiagram
  participant S as GameSession
  participant I as InputController
  participant R as RingSystem
  participant P as PlayerController
  participant W as CollisionWorld
  participant V as RenderSystem
  Note over S,V: Required terrain is ready before this fixed tick
  S->>I: snapshot input
  I-->>S: commands
  S->>R: updatePhase(tick)
  S->>P: step(input, 1/120)
  opt Grounded at tick start
    P->>R: getSupportSpeed()
    R-->>P: ring tangential speed
    P->>P: vx = relative speed + ring speed
  end
  Note over P,W: On departure retain world vx<br/>Do not add carry again
  P->>W: relative swept movement
  W-->>P: motion and contacts
  P->>P: update support and mode
  S->>V: interpolate completed states
  V->>V: ring phase minus player angle
